# Wiki log

Append-only chronology of knowledge-base operations. One heading per operation.
`csdd wiki lint` flags any `## [` heading that does not match the format below.

> **Entry format:** `## [YYYY-MM-DD] <op> | <title>` where
> `op ∈ ingest | query | lint | refactor`. `grep "^## \[" log.md | tail -5` must
> always list the five most recent operations.

